;==================================================
; Hack Speed Skill Settings (HackSkillCheck.txt)
; Types:
; 0: Show message in log only
; 1: Disconnect User
; 2: Disable Attack
; 3: Disable attack by x miliseconds
; 4: Disconnect User & bloc account
; 5: Ignore over hits
;==================================================
